{"4217400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Time to Die", "steam_appid": 4217400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/1db91e1051c2ad83a65a167fc2d3373a.poster.avif?t=1782401307\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/1db91e1051c2ad83a65a167fc2d3373a.webm?t=1782401307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/1db91e1051c2ad83a65a167fc2d3373a.mp4?t=1782401307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time To Die is a tactical, dice-based roguelike traversing a constantly ticking clock. Customize 100s of die faces by adding keywords and numbers to create your own unique dice. Every roll brings high stakes, outwit your foes with cunning strategy in a world where every turn of the clock matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/b8f8bcd711f69f917684b9c1706e9212.avif?t=1782401307\" width=1424 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/acf40b7e4dede7cf8085b05d05f80708.poster.avif?t=1782401307\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/acf40b7e4dede7cf8085b05d05f80708.webm?t=1782401307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/acf40b7e4dede7cf8085b05d05f80708.mp4?t=1782401307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design each character’s dice by collecting 100+ new faces and upgrading them with the various traders in game. Select faces that work together to create combos and builds to defeat foes. Every face you see in game is obtainable and playable! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/70db0e8c117e5e5fa4e11dee1333cc22.avif?t=1782401307\" width=1424 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/f5c3b68561b52c757d8de1df17723a02.poster.avif?t=1782401307\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/f5c3b68561b52c757d8de1df17723a02.webm?t=1782401307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/f5c3b68561b52c757d8de1df17723a02.mp4?t=1782401307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique party from 6 playable characters, with more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/20a667e8b041cddde7b38b9bb5194d9e.avif?t=1782401307\" width=1424 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217400/extras/c6ff641a4201f9707c55d7b8e0609a86.poster.avif?t=178240130